# read-before-c-format

Always read relevant C sources and headers before any formatting or edit to preserve control flow and architecture clarity

## Constraints

- Glob for .c/.h files
- Grep for call sites and definitions
- Read before StrReplace

Evidence: turns 1-3,14: repeated Grep+Read before edits to constants and rules
